WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
[English subtitles are available]

01:29.810 --> 01:31.180
[My Journey to You]

01:31.200 --> 01:34.080
[Episode 22]

02:00.170 --> 02:01.620
You completed the Trial of the Three Realms

02:01.620 --> 02:03.020
in such a short time.

02:03.800 --> 02:05.460
Your father must be very proud

02:05.860 --> 02:07.040
in the heavens.

02:15.210 --> 02:17.410
When can I make my father proud for once?

02:22.650 --> 02:23.970
The child you adopted

02:24.350 --> 02:27.040
memorized all the rare herbs when he was six.

02:28.240 --> 02:29.970
Although he doesn't talk much,

02:30.570 --> 02:31.130
he is

02:31.390 --> 02:32.140
smart.

02:33.280 --> 02:34.880
On the contrary, my child...

02:38.820 --> 02:39.820
He's still young.

02:40.290 --> 02:41.950
You need to give him more time.

02:43.150 --> 02:44.980
You know the talents of a child when they are 3 years old.

02:44.980 --> 02:45.650
This kid

02:45.950 --> 02:46.850
is not gifted.

02:47.650 --> 02:49.050
He won't be accomplished

02:49.220 --> 02:51.020
in weapon casting in the future.

02:58.300 --> 02:59.350
I hope my efforts

02:59.620 --> 03:00.970
can be useful today

03:01.570 --> 03:03.030
and really help everyone.

03:04.140 --> 03:04.790
Shanji,

03:05.610 --> 03:06.740
I'm counting on you.

03:13.680 --> 03:15.900
You didn't even let me attend your Sword Wielder ritual

03:15.900 --> 03:17.620
and brought me to the Yue residence.

03:17.620 --> 03:19.820
I don't know what Gong Ziyu is thinking.

03:21.240 --> 03:23.300
The waterway of the front hill has been cut off and sealed.

03:23.300 --> 03:25.630
Only the exit of the bamboo forest is left.

03:26.550 --> 03:27.810
I'll send you up first.

03:28.170 --> 03:29.370
When you settle down,

03:29.870 --> 03:32.000
I'll go guard you in the bamboo forest.

03:33.170 --> 03:35.329
Aren't you going to watch Gong Ziyu put on the Sword Wielder's gown?

03:35.329 --> 03:38.460
If you miss it, you'll regret it for the rest of your life.

03:46.030 --> 03:46.910
I wish I could.

03:47.440 --> 03:50.150
But the Sword Wielder asked me to stay in the Yue residence to protect you.

03:50.150 --> 03:52.150
How can I not obey the Sword Wielder?

03:52.670 --> 03:54.130
And his exact words were to

03:54.160 --> 03:55.290
not leave you alone.

03:56.720 --> 03:57.780
Not leave me alone?

03:57.960 --> 03:59.660
Then why are you going to the bamboo forest?

03:59.660 --> 04:00.590
Stay close

04:01.240 --> 04:01.930
with me.

04:07.830 --> 04:09.290
This is more than one inch.

04:09.310 --> 04:10.370
It's almost a foot.

04:11.110 --> 04:12.310
Don't push your luck.

04:12.500 --> 04:13.340
Hurry up.

04:14.960 --> 04:16.850
Or I'll complain to the Sword Wielder

04:16.850 --> 04:18.779
that you refused to obey his order.

04:28.670 --> 04:29.530
It's poking me.

04:30.540 --> 04:31.260
Same here.

05:18.460 --> 05:19.540
The tea is so cold.

05:25.540 --> 05:27.120
You came all the way here

05:28.720 --> 05:30.780
not just to have some cold tea, right?

05:33.150 --> 05:34.090
I know

05:34.700 --> 05:36.360
you're resentful towards me.

05:37.440 --> 05:39.500
But I’m here to remind you sincerely.

05:40.990 --> 05:43.920
Shangguan Qian has stolen your secret weapon pouch.

05:44.070 --> 05:45.250
Haven’t you noticed

05:45.800 --> 05:48.930
that there were fragments missing from your treasures?

06:00.040 --> 06:01.370
I'm giving you a new one.

06:01.890 --> 06:02.850
You can decide

06:04.030 --> 06:06.300
what poison you want to put in this hidden weapon.

06:06.300 --> 06:07.300
No need to tell me.

06:14.140 --> 06:15.200
No need to thank me.

06:16.260 --> 06:18.190
You should thank Young Master Hua.

06:18.360 --> 06:20.490
It was him who made this hidden weapon.

06:20.670 --> 06:22.290
I'm just giving you a pouch.

06:27.750 --> 06:28.820
This tea is hot.

07:12.060 --> 07:13.860
Wufeng will attack in five days.

07:14.180 --> 07:15.310
Among all the Wangs,

07:15.590 --> 07:17.330
except the most mysterious Wang of the South,

07:17.330 --> 07:18.930
Situ Hong, who isn't coming,

07:19.370 --> 07:20.330
the other three

07:20.380 --> 07:22.310
have reached the Jiucheng Valley.

07:22.500 --> 07:23.990
Wang of the East, Bei Xu.

07:25.020 --> 07:26.740
Wang of the North, Han Yike.

07:27.450 --> 07:28.460
Wang of the West,

07:28.590 --> 07:29.510
Mo Ji'ai.

07:30.540 --> 07:32.180
They will split into three groups

07:32.180 --> 07:33.460
and move forward at the same time.

07:33.460 --> 07:34.320
Their target is

07:34.600 --> 07:35.710
Infinite Heat.

07:36.470 --> 07:40.040
According to the painting of the Gong residence that Yun Weishan made,

07:40.040 --> 07:43.100
in order to prevent the Gong family's powers to gather,

07:43.380 --> 07:45.110
we will split into three groups

07:45.710 --> 07:47.409
and move forward at the same time,

07:47.409 --> 07:48.810
breaking them one by one.

07:50.290 --> 07:52.020
We can split into three groups.

07:52.409 --> 07:53.400
But don't forget

07:54.470 --> 07:55.800
our most important goal

07:57.010 --> 07:58.210
is Infinite Heat.

08:05.020 --> 08:06.380
In order to control the front hill,

08:06.380 --> 08:07.480
there will be seven Chi

08:07.480 --> 08:08.080
and Mei

08:08.420 --> 08:11.150
who pretend to be a bride to enter the Gong family.

08:11.340 --> 08:13.070
At the Sword Wielder's ritual,

08:13.380 --> 08:15.510
Gong Ziyu will choose the bride again.

08:16.340 --> 08:17.620
Why don't we let Wufeng

08:17.940 --> 08:19.740
to send another seven Chi and Mei

08:20.540 --> 08:21.820
to take on that?

08:22.370 --> 08:24.630
Although Chi and Mei are mostly useless,

08:25.940 --> 08:27.560
but to restrain Gong Ziyu

08:28.270 --> 08:30.130
and create chaos at the front hill

08:30.250 --> 08:31.930
to attract the guardians' attention

08:31.930 --> 08:34.200
can help our division

08:34.909 --> 08:35.880
to win time.

08:36.799 --> 08:38.610
The Gong family is complicated.

08:40.419 --> 08:41.220
It'd be good to be able to

08:41.220 --> 08:42.880
mess up their organization.

08:43.710 --> 08:44.510
That's right.

08:45.140 --> 08:45.870
Yun Weishan.

08:46.550 --> 08:48.280
Didn't you become a bride once?

08:48.920 --> 08:49.750
Do it again.

08:50.190 --> 08:51.590
You already know the way.

08:52.330 --> 08:53.860
And when Gong Ziyu sees you,

08:54.600 --> 08:56.260
he definitely won't harm you.

08:58.340 --> 09:00.140
You can definitely control him.

09:03.110 --> 09:03.800
No problem.

09:06.050 --> 09:06.580
Brother.

09:07.010 --> 09:08.070
I'm still worried.

09:08.420 --> 09:09.550
I'll guard outside.

09:11.990 --> 09:14.320
The three Wang will be divided into three groups

09:14.320 --> 09:17.250
and attack the Jue residence where Gong Shangjue is,

09:17.810 --> 09:19.620
the Yue residence at the back hill,

09:19.620 --> 09:21.820
and the Saber Tomb of the Hua residence.

09:22.430 --> 09:25.170
The one in charge of attacking Jue residence and Gong Shangjue

09:25.170 --> 09:26.300
is the Wang of the West,

09:26.300 --> 09:27.060
Mo Ji'ai.

09:27.830 --> 09:29.260
The flying dagger he uses with both hands

09:29.260 --> 09:30.310
are extremely mysterious,

09:30.310 --> 09:31.490
making it hard to get close.

09:31.490 --> 09:32.240
Be alert.

09:33.150 --> 09:34.070
In the Gong family,

09:34.070 --> 09:36.470
the strongest person is the Gong Shangjue.

09:36.470 --> 09:37.870
We internally judge that

09:37.900 --> 09:38.630
his strength

09:39.070 --> 09:40.070
is equal to a Wang.

09:40.730 --> 09:43.330
But Shangguan Qian has found out his weakness.

09:43.610 --> 09:44.790
In five days,

09:45.140 --> 09:47.740
his internal skill will be completely voided.

09:47.920 --> 09:49.740
In order to keep this secret,

09:49.760 --> 09:51.620
and not have anyone know about it,

09:53.320 --> 09:55.650
he definitely will not fight it in public,

09:57.290 --> 09:59.290
but he won't take the risk to appear.

10:01.320 --> 10:02.380
Everyone in Wufeng

10:04.580 --> 10:06.180
are afraid of Gong Shangjue.

10:06.490 --> 10:07.890
Let me deal with him then.

10:09.010 --> 10:11.300
My Flying Dagger can fight from a distance.

10:11.300 --> 10:12.830
Gong Shangjue uses knives.

10:13.300 --> 10:15.760
Close combat has no advantage in front of me.

10:16.570 --> 10:19.100
In addition, with his internal skill voided,

10:19.140 --> 10:20.670
he must be of no match for me.

10:22.450 --> 10:24.260
Gong Yuanzhi is good at using hidden weapons.

10:24.260 --> 10:25.060
He can control

10:25.060 --> 10:27.660
Mo Ji'ai who also attacks with ranged weapons.

10:28.780 --> 10:31.510
The second path is the Wang of the North, Han Yike.

10:31.590 --> 10:33.390
This man is vicious and precise.

10:33.630 --> 10:36.450
His weapon is the modified Mother Crescent Knife.

10:37.050 --> 10:39.580
The sharp blade can cut off the opponent's weapon.

10:39.580 --> 10:40.480
At the same time,

10:40.480 --> 10:42.810
his Crescent Knife contains magnets

10:43.310 --> 10:45.230
that can attract the opponent's weapon.

10:45.230 --> 10:46.560
Remember to be careful.

10:46.780 --> 10:48.440
The internal skill of Han Yike

10:48.440 --> 10:49.640
is extremely cold.

10:50.120 --> 10:51.890
It can stop the opponent's internal skill,

10:51.890 --> 10:53.020
arms and feet stiff,

10:53.190 --> 10:55.750
the Three Forms of Snow Saber have practically no use on him.

10:55.750 --> 10:56.570
Then I’ll

10:56.780 --> 10:58.110
take the Xue residence.

10:59.180 --> 11:00.900
Their Three Forms of Snow Saber

11:00.900 --> 11:01.780
are

11:02.030 --> 11:03.290
nothing in front of me.

11:03.710 --> 11:05.730
So you must let Xue Chongzi and Young Master Xue

11:05.730 --> 11:06.910
give up the Xue residence

11:06.910 --> 11:08.500
and go to the Yue residence to hide

11:08.500 --> 11:09.680
and meet Elder Yue.

11:11.780 --> 11:13.910
It’s best to let Jin Fan guard them too.

11:15.980 --> 11:19.580
I'll clean up the Yue residence after handling the Xue residence.

11:19.580 --> 11:20.770
From the map,

11:21.150 --> 11:23.080
these two places are not far apart.

11:23.130 --> 11:25.060
The Xue residence doesn't matter.

11:25.670 --> 11:27.400
The point is the Yue residence.

11:27.520 --> 11:28.780
Of course I know.

11:29.450 --> 11:31.910
There are Herb Elixirs in the Yue residence,

11:33.080 --> 11:33.950
Wufeng

11:34.620 --> 11:36.440
has always wanted that.

11:39.370 --> 11:41.830
The Yue residence has Chuyun Chonglian too.

11:53.590 --> 11:54.390
The last path

11:54.600 --> 11:55.880
is the head of the Four Wangs.

11:55.880 --> 11:57.680
He is the Wang of the East, Bei Xu.

11:58.460 --> 12:00.920
He is the top swordsman in the martial world.

12:01.000 --> 12:02.600
He hasn't been defeated yet.

12:03.250 --> 12:04.450
So his goal

12:05.020 --> 12:06.720
is to head straight to the Saber Tomb of the Hua residence

12:06.720 --> 12:08.720
to get the Infinite Heat blueprint.

12:14.850 --> 12:15.650
Thank you.

12:18.310 --> 12:18.990
Yun.

12:20.900 --> 12:22.490
You must protect yourself.

12:35.630 --> 12:36.970
Under the order of the Sword Wielder,

12:36.970 --> 12:39.110
I'm here to serve you.

12:40.250 --> 12:42.710
The soft sword is hidden in the bride's belt.

12:42.980 --> 12:44.660
Their hairpin and jewelleries

12:44.660 --> 12:46.550
are all hidden weapons laced with poison.

12:46.550 --> 12:48.690
The Gong family is heavily guarded.

12:49.300 --> 12:50.630
Every guard's location

12:50.670 --> 12:52.470
was strictly calculated.

12:53.080 --> 12:54.470
The support from various ends

12:54.470 --> 12:55.930
will arrive very quickly.

12:56.230 --> 12:58.160
Once our whereabouts are exposed,

12:58.690 --> 13:00.690
and the whistling arrow is sounded,

13:00.900 --> 13:02.280
people on the front hill of the Gong residence

13:02.280 --> 13:04.050
will go straight to the Hua residence

13:04.050 --> 13:05.780
and protect the Infinite Heat.

13:06.110 --> 13:08.310
So you must complete the task.

13:09.620 --> 13:11.020
So that I can enjoy myself

13:11.050 --> 13:12.920
at the Saber Tomb

13:14.050 --> 13:15.250
of the Hua residence.

13:15.690 --> 13:18.290
No one has seen the Infinite Heat's blueprint.

13:18.570 --> 13:20.100
How can we tell if it's true?

13:20.120 --> 13:21.800
The Infinite Heat's blueprint

13:21.800 --> 13:23.940
is carved on unique Xuan iron.

13:24.890 --> 13:28.230
If you hit it with a sword, it will make a special sound

13:29.680 --> 13:31.480
that sounds like sad bird crows,

13:32.850 --> 13:34.070
like autumn rain...

13:36.510 --> 13:38.440
Like a graceful maiden's whimper,

13:39.910 --> 13:41.370
like an Emperor's sad cry.

13:44.130 --> 13:45.140
It's unique

13:46.050 --> 13:47.100
and hard to forge.

14:02.710 --> 14:06.840
The Infinite Heat blueprint in the Saber Tomb of the Hua residence is fake.

14:07.390 --> 14:09.450
This is the real Xuan iron blueprint.

14:10.900 --> 14:12.760
Put it at the bottom of the Ice Pool

14:12.980 --> 14:14.850
and quickly abandon the Xue residence

14:14.850 --> 14:16.590
to meet with Elder Yue.

14:19.510 --> 14:21.070
Even if Han Yike comes here,

14:22.580 --> 14:24.700
seeing an empty house you've given up,

14:24.700 --> 14:25.960
he wouldn't think that

14:26.340 --> 14:28.200
the real Infinite Heat blueprint

14:29.070 --> 14:31.870
will be placed in a place that is not guarded at all.

14:36.190 --> 14:37.250
It's finally here.

14:39.570 --> 14:40.770
The final battle.

15:53.730 --> 15:55.530
Where is Young Master Shangjue?

15:56.130 --> 15:57.790
I heard Young Master Shangjue is sick.

15:57.790 --> 15:59.190
He's resting in his room.

16:03.590 --> 16:04.870
What about Young Master Yuanzhi?

16:04.870 --> 16:07.800
Young Master Yuanzhi is with Young Master Shangjue.

16:16.610 --> 16:17.410
This is

16:17.850 --> 16:19.310
the Sword Wielder's seal.

16:21.230 --> 16:21.800
Today,

16:22.730 --> 16:23.730
I grant it to you.

16:26.020 --> 16:27.280
For the Gong family,

16:28.460 --> 16:29.300
do your

16:29.850 --> 16:30.750
very best.

16:41.170 --> 16:41.930
Gong Ziyu,

16:43.290 --> 16:44.240
is willing to

16:45.430 --> 16:47.290
do everything for the Gong family

16:47.870 --> 16:49.010
until death.

17:03.800 --> 17:05.500
Bow.

17:06.300 --> 17:08.119
Greetings, Sword Wielder.

17:15.290 --> 17:16.819
The ceremony is completed.

17:44.380 --> 17:45.410
Sword Wilder,

17:45.640 --> 17:47.110
please pick the bride.

18:40.460 --> 18:41.230
Ziyi?

18:44.240 --> 18:45.040
How did you...

18:46.250 --> 18:47.960
If you can't do it,

18:48.750 --> 18:49.700
I can help.

18:54.570 --> 18:55.600
She finally left.

18:56.340 --> 18:57.720
Acting was so hard.

18:59.380 --> 19:00.330
What do you mean?

19:00.730 --> 19:01.550
Did you think

19:01.570 --> 19:04.030
what we were talking about was the real plan?

19:04.470 --> 19:06.190
That's what we want them to hear.

19:06.190 --> 19:07.650
What's the real plan then?

19:12.790 --> 19:13.480
Forget it.

19:14.820 --> 19:16.150
I don't deserve to know.

19:16.840 --> 19:18.970
What about Gong Ziyu on the front hill?

19:19.430 --> 19:21.500
Are you really not worried about him at all?

19:21.500 --> 19:23.830
After all, he has passed the three trials.

19:24.510 --> 19:26.590
What if those Chi and Mei brides

19:26.710 --> 19:27.850
can't hold him back

19:28.140 --> 19:30.220
and he runs to the back hill to look for support?

19:30.220 --> 19:31.380
Do you think

19:32.010 --> 19:34.340
there can only be Yun Weishan within the bride?

19:34.340 --> 19:35.340
Who else is there?

19:36.550 --> 19:37.480
There's also me.

19:39.110 --> 19:40.040
With her around,

19:41.230 --> 19:42.290
I can rest assured.

19:45.240 --> 19:45.880
Miss Ziyi,

19:46.710 --> 19:47.490
who are you?

19:48.800 --> 19:50.080
My name is not Ziyi.

19:51.930 --> 19:53.610
This bridal red dress

19:54.380 --> 19:55.750
suits me better.

19:57.300 --> 19:58.360
Young Master Ziyu,

19:59.950 --> 20:01.230
my real name is

20:02.980 --> 20:04.300
Situ Hong.

20:18.860 --> 20:19.890
I was right.

20:21.110 --> 20:21.930
Yun Weishan,

20:22.260 --> 20:23.670
you really betrayed Wufeng.

20:23.670 --> 20:24.210
Yun.

20:25.220 --> 20:26.280
Young Master Ziyu.

20:28.900 --> 20:30.430
I have a deal with Wufeng.

20:31.090 --> 20:32.820
As long as I finish the mission,

20:32.910 --> 20:34.260
I'll be free.

20:35.290 --> 20:36.020
In the past,

20:36.860 --> 20:38.060
I had no choice.

20:39.240 --> 20:40.430
But now I can choose.

20:44.700 --> 20:45.680
Poor you.

20:46.550 --> 20:48.150
You still don't understand.

20:48.290 --> 20:49.550
Once you enter Wufeng,

20:50.850 --> 20:52.130
you have no choice.

20:53.100 --> 20:54.430
You are the pitiful one.

22:20.410 --> 22:21.940
You're the Wang of the North,

22:21.940 --> 22:22.760
Han Yike?

22:23.840 --> 22:26.310
Yun Weishan really delivered the news.

22:28.580 --> 22:29.190
No.

22:30.410 --> 22:31.810
He's the Wang of the West,

22:32.490 --> 22:33.160
Mo Ji'ai.

22:34.340 --> 22:36.400
Looks like this pair of Flying Dagger

22:36.860 --> 22:38.120
is more famous than me.

22:39.890 --> 22:40.960
How did you find us?

22:41.420 --> 22:42.660
People can hide,

22:42.700 --> 22:44.110
but not footprints.

22:44.420 --> 22:45.430
One of you

22:45.540 --> 22:47.600
need to practice your Qinggong more.

22:49.210 --> 22:50.340
Looks like it's you.

22:55.280 --> 22:56.860
There is snow in the Xue residence

22:56.860 --> 22:58.690
so there are footprints for you to identify.

22:58.690 --> 23:00.750
But after leaving the Xue residence,

23:01.060 --> 23:02.260
it's the wilderness.

23:02.950 --> 23:04.280
How can there be footprints?

23:04.280 --> 23:05.850
How stubborn.

23:06.480 --> 23:08.020
If you follow the direction of the footprints,

23:08.020 --> 23:08.900
it won't be hard to tell

23:08.900 --> 23:10.920
the place you're going to is the Yue residence.

23:10.920 --> 23:11.670
I just need to

23:11.670 --> 23:13.060
wait for you on the path that you have to cross

23:13.060 --> 23:14.020
to get to the Yue residence.

23:14.020 --> 23:14.680
It's just that

23:14.680 --> 23:16.080
I'm better at Qinggong

23:16.110 --> 23:17.970
and I'm just one step ahead of you.

23:20.260 --> 23:22.050
Why are you so familiar with

23:22.280 --> 23:23.200
the back hill?

23:26.630 --> 23:28.290
It's drawn on the map.

23:28.670 --> 23:30.640
I'd have Miss Yun Weishan to thank.

23:31.080 --> 23:32.410
But I didn't expect

23:32.580 --> 23:34.710
the legendary Gong family's back hill

23:34.990 --> 23:36.900
is guarded by a child.

23:37.300 --> 23:38.270
Since you know

23:38.620 --> 23:40.640
the inner skill of Han Yike

23:40.960 --> 23:43.290
suppresses the Three Forms of Snow Saber,

23:43.390 --> 23:44.860
why isn't he here?

23:44.990 --> 23:47.870
The famous Three Forms of Snow Saber and Three Forms of Moon Slash

23:47.870 --> 23:48.830
are useless

23:48.900 --> 23:50.080
in front of me.

23:50.980 --> 23:51.630
Besides,

23:52.220 --> 23:52.910
Han Yike

23:52.910 --> 23:55.370
has to go deal with those fated to be with him.

24:20.700 --> 24:21.290
These

24:21.540 --> 24:23.880
are the new weapons made by Eldest Young Miss and me,

24:23.880 --> 24:24.630
Mountain Destroyer.

24:24.630 --> 24:25.660
So there was an ambush.

24:25.660 --> 24:27.740
Send these Mountain Destroyer to the front hill

24:27.740 --> 24:29.400
and hide them under the eaves.

24:30.580 --> 24:32.580
You must protect the Sword Wielder.

24:32.870 --> 24:33.370
Yes.

24:34.420 --> 24:35.620
Mountain Destroyer,

24:35.870 --> 24:37.000
I'm counting on you.

24:46.230 --> 24:47.830
Today, Wufeng can only come,

24:49.130 --> 24:50.180
but never return.

25:18.120 --> 25:20.620
If I don't enter the Yue residence through the waterway,

25:20.620 --> 25:23.020
then I will have to enter from the back gate.

25:23.040 --> 25:25.440
This Chuyun Chonglian is really precious.

25:25.560 --> 25:26.610
So the third one

25:26.780 --> 25:29.110
is given to Young Master Yue for research.

25:29.970 --> 25:31.170
According to the map,

25:32.070 --> 25:34.200
there should be a bamboo forest ahead.

25:45.910 --> 25:46.840
It's you.

25:47.550 --> 25:48.350
Mother!

25:49.420 --> 25:50.140
Brother...

26:08.730 --> 26:09.700
Ten years ago,

26:10.300 --> 26:12.560
I failed to reunite you with your family.

26:12.830 --> 26:14.050
That child must be

26:14.070 --> 26:15.870
still waiting for you down there.

26:15.870 --> 26:17.130
How lonely he is.

26:17.830 --> 26:19.110
Don't let him

26:19.510 --> 26:20.490
wait too long.

26:22.430 --> 26:24.420
You've lost all your internal skill.

26:24.420 --> 26:25.160
Let me

26:25.700 --> 26:26.830
send you on your way.

26:39.110 --> 26:39.700
Why?

26:43.520 --> 26:44.530
There is a magnet

26:44.760 --> 26:45.580
in his weapon.

26:46.350 --> 26:48.680
It can attract hidden weapons and swords.

26:48.790 --> 26:49.450
Be careful.

26:50.750 --> 26:51.280
Brother.

26:51.860 --> 26:52.530
Who is he?

26:54.060 --> 26:54.880
It's him...

26:56.710 --> 26:58.920
who killed my mother and Lang.

27:12.910 --> 27:15.510
I wonder how Gong Ziyu and the others are doing.

27:21.670 --> 27:23.270
In order to lure the enemy in,

27:23.770 --> 27:25.790
the front hill must be in chaos now.

27:27.890 --> 27:29.690
He's worried that you can't move

27:29.820 --> 27:31.480
so he sent you here in advance.

27:32.150 --> 27:33.690
Don’t let him down.

27:35.730 --> 27:37.530
Elder Yue and I will be guarding.

27:37.660 --> 27:38.960
Just wait for the news.

27:41.800 --> 27:43.640
Everything is going according to plan.

27:43.640 --> 27:44.370
Don't worry.

27:45.330 --> 27:46.500
It's within the plan.

27:46.500 --> 27:47.220
Besides,

27:47.640 --> 27:49.230
Xue Chongzi and Young Master Xue

27:49.230 --> 27:51.760
will come to the Yue residence to meet us soon.

27:58.500 --> 27:59.780
Why is your internal skill

27:59.780 --> 28:00.660
still here?

28:46.900 --> 28:48.230
You were well prepared.

28:49.020 --> 28:50.350
You were also involved.

28:53.200 --> 28:54.400
Will you trust me?

29:00.050 --> 29:01.590
Elder Yue once told me

29:03.100 --> 29:05.760
even if Yun Que were still in the Gong residence,

29:06.310 --> 29:08.170
as long as Wufeng is still around,

29:08.450 --> 29:09.480
she will always

29:10.470 --> 29:12.470
live in the shadow of fear.

29:14.610 --> 29:15.240
So,

29:17.280 --> 29:19.140
if we want to be together forever,

29:19.570 --> 29:21.300
we must get rid of Wufeng first.

29:23.750 --> 29:24.700
But I can't

29:25.430 --> 29:26.860
do this on my own.

29:27.990 --> 29:28.870
I need you.

29:28.900 --> 29:29.900
No matter what,

29:32.170 --> 29:33.700
I am willing to do it for you.

29:39.990 --> 29:41.650
I need you to work with me

29:42.720 --> 29:44.420
to make it look like I'm helping you.

29:44.420 --> 29:45.480
What are you doing?

29:45.660 --> 29:47.950
I want to take Yun Weishan back to the front hill for interrogation.

29:47.950 --> 29:49.530
If the Gong family is in chaos,

29:49.530 --> 29:51.230
there will be a conflict between the front and the back hill.

29:51.230 --> 29:52.210
For a woman,

29:52.300 --> 29:54.630
you're gambling with your entire family?

29:54.820 --> 29:56.210
Do you deserve your title as the Sword Wielder?

29:56.210 --> 29:57.740
A disgrace to the Gong family!

29:57.740 --> 29:59.550
We must act together to put on a performance.

29:59.550 --> 30:00.050
Stop!

30:00.580 --> 30:01.630
How disgraceful!

30:01.820 --> 30:03.220
You lie to Shangguan Qian

30:03.430 --> 30:04.610
and make her feel that

30:04.610 --> 30:05.700
the Gong family is in chaos and

30:05.700 --> 30:06.960
is about to fall apart.

30:07.450 --> 30:09.300
After Gong Ziyu was elected as the Sword Wielder,

30:09.300 --> 30:10.950
we'll have to obey him.

30:11.440 --> 30:12.490
We admit defeat.

30:13.100 --> 30:13.900
I refuse!

30:23.980 --> 30:25.180
There are some things

30:26.120 --> 30:27.680
that only she can do.

30:31.630 --> 30:32.740
I'll do anything

30:33.100 --> 30:33.980
for you.

30:41.120 --> 30:42.720
I'll only say it once.

30:42.950 --> 30:43.710
Yes.

30:44.090 --> 30:46.650
I'm ordering you as the Sword Wielder of the Gong family

30:46.650 --> 30:47.310
to back off!

30:48.060 --> 30:48.900
We will obey

30:49.270 --> 30:50.700
the Sword Wielder's orders.

30:50.700 --> 30:51.420
Then let her

30:52.090 --> 30:53.260
spread the news.

30:54.020 --> 30:56.000
This is the secret passage to leave the Gong family

30:56.000 --> 30:58.240
and how to close the secret passage.

30:59.300 --> 31:02.220
If Gong Ziyu really takes the position of the Sword Wielder,

31:02.220 --> 31:03.620
the Gong family is not far

31:04.090 --> 31:05.350
from being destroyed.

31:05.450 --> 31:06.940
Why don't we help him?

31:07.660 --> 31:08.310
How?

31:08.790 --> 31:10.090
Gather the elites

31:10.620 --> 31:12.020
to attack the Gong family

31:12.070 --> 31:13.400
while they are in chaos,

31:13.920 --> 31:15.050
ambushing them all.

31:16.310 --> 31:17.420
Ten years ago,

31:18.430 --> 31:20.560
a catastrophe fell at the Gong family.

31:21.140 --> 31:22.400
But for Wufeng,

31:23.030 --> 31:24.230
it was also a hard hit.

31:24.590 --> 31:25.470
After that,

31:25.870 --> 31:28.000
Wufeng has been hiding for many years.

31:29.300 --> 31:31.370
Instead of waiting for them

31:31.690 --> 31:34.550
to attack again when they are fully-fledged again,

31:35.010 --> 31:37.000
we might as well set up a trap

31:38.140 --> 31:39.340
to lure them in first.

31:40.050 --> 31:41.650
So you exposed your identity

31:41.980 --> 31:42.870
on purpose?

31:43.470 --> 31:43.980
Yes.

31:45.240 --> 31:46.420
If I don't expose myself,

31:46.420 --> 31:47.890
how can I let you

31:48.240 --> 31:50.340
arrange for a Mei to sneak in as a bridal candidate

31:50.340 --> 31:51.370
to be ambused?

31:51.770 --> 31:52.890
To welcome you,

31:53.980 --> 31:55.970
we chose a good day.

31:56.580 --> 31:57.110
Today,

31:57.510 --> 31:58.470
is the auspicious day

31:58.470 --> 32:00.270
to send you Wufeng to your death!

32:00.850 --> 32:02.450
The so-called fortnight

32:02.530 --> 32:03.370
dark moments

32:03.940 --> 32:05.030
were also delibrately

32:05.030 --> 32:06.750
made known to Shangguan Qian by you?

32:06.750 --> 32:09.420
Full of trickery, and you must've been waiting for long.

32:09.420 --> 32:11.350
We have to let you in on some things.

32:12.450 --> 32:14.050
Good plan, Young Master Jue.

32:15.490 --> 32:17.220
I also want to be praised by you.

32:17.450 --> 32:18.680
But I'm not the one

32:19.400 --> 32:20.460
who has a good plan,

32:45.090 --> 32:45.810
but you.

32:46.460 --> 32:48.790
The chicken soup I asked Jin Fan to deliver

32:49.100 --> 32:51.250
has knockout drops that are orderless and tasteless.

32:51.250 --> 32:52.310
Have you forgotten

32:54.310 --> 32:55.910
that I also take Herb Elixir?

32:55.970 --> 32:56.770
Of course not.

32:57.910 --> 32:59.770
I just wanted the guards to faint,

32:59.860 --> 33:01.190
not to save Yun Weishan.

33:02.440 --> 33:03.770
You must be curious as to

33:04.150 --> 33:04.880
why Lady Wuji

33:05.770 --> 33:07.860
exposed the injury on Yun Weishan.

33:13.240 --> 33:13.890
Actually,

33:14.590 --> 33:15.930
I asked her to say that.

33:18.920 --> 33:19.670
You did this

33:21.180 --> 33:23.110
just for Yun Weishan to tell me that

33:23.980 --> 33:25.980
Shangguan Qian is also a Wufeng spy.

33:26.820 --> 33:27.320
Are you

33:29.290 --> 33:31.020
someone from Wufeng?

33:31.790 --> 33:32.470
I am.

33:35.430 --> 33:36.100
Also,

33:37.610 --> 33:39.060
Shangguan Qian is too.

33:44.840 --> 33:45.360
Yes.

33:46.310 --> 33:47.040
But I believe

33:47.780 --> 33:50.240
you have been suspicious of Shangguan Qian,

33:50.450 --> 33:52.580
but there has been no evidence, right?

33:55.220 --> 33:58.020
I thought you wanted the position of Sword Wielder

33:58.200 --> 33:59.660
and did whatever it takes,

34:00.130 --> 34:02.260
even to the lengths of killing Father.

34:04.100 --> 34:06.940
But after experiencing the Trial of the Three Realms,

34:06.940 --> 34:07.780
I realized

34:09.760 --> 34:11.960
the one who can pass these various tests

34:13.330 --> 34:15.659
must have given up everything of their own

34:16.980 --> 34:18.380
and put the protection of

34:18.889 --> 34:21.020
the Gong family and the Jiuchen Valley

34:21.210 --> 34:23.050
at the top.

34:27.659 --> 34:28.310
Although

34:30.219 --> 34:31.550
I don't want to say this,

34:34.020 --> 34:34.520
I...

34:37.420 --> 34:39.280
have indeed underestimated you.

34:44.000 --> 34:45.179
I owe you an apology.

34:52.699 --> 34:54.230
I think I misjudged you too.

34:56.060 --> 34:57.020
Let's not

34:59.360 --> 35:00.760
apologize to each other.

35:02.380 --> 35:03.260
What I need

35:04.690 --> 35:05.820
is not your apology.

35:06.420 --> 35:07.620
What do you want then?

35:09.170 --> 35:11.290
I want you to put on a big show with me.

35:19.150 --> 35:19.820
Brother!

35:31.370 --> 35:32.630
Go get some guards!

35:32.910 --> 35:33.770
Go!

35:36.940 --> 35:37.600
Brother...

35:40.280 --> 35:40.940
Brother...

35:49.100 --> 35:51.600
The chaos at the Gong family has always been a show.

35:51.600 --> 35:53.800
Those who are too into it and have no idea

35:54.120 --> 35:55.250
are only the Wufeng.

35:56.270 --> 35:57.800
The blade of the Gong family

35:58.160 --> 35:59.480
never points inwards,

36:00.340 --> 36:01.480
but outwards.

36:02.000 --> 36:03.120
Be careful, Young Master.

36:03.120 --> 36:04.340
Her blood is poisonous.

36:04.340 --> 36:05.400
I have Herb Elixir.

36:06.390 --> 36:07.650
You should be careful.

36:08.450 --> 36:09.570
I often wondered,

36:10.010 --> 36:11.870
you, Yun Weishan, are so capable,

36:12.300 --> 36:13.830
and have delicate thoughts,

36:13.830 --> 36:15.700
how could you just be a Chi?

36:15.720 --> 36:16.980
As we climb the levels,

36:17.380 --> 36:18.220
our hands are

36:19.190 --> 36:20.360
tainted with

36:20.570 --> 36:21.230
more blood.

36:22.000 --> 36:23.330
But the blood on my hands

36:24.920 --> 36:26.310
is my own blood.

37:20.220 --> 37:20.800
Young Master Ziyu.

37:20.800 --> 37:21.800
Are you all right?

37:23.890 --> 37:24.520
I think...

37:26.770 --> 37:27.630
I was poisoned.

37:30.180 --> 37:31.430
Don't you have Herb Elixir?

37:31.430 --> 37:32.890
How could you be poisoned?

37:34.100 --> 37:35.500
Because it's not poison.

37:36.830 --> 37:37.830
It's witchcraft.

37:59.650 --> 38:00.640
Why are you here?

38:02.090 --> 38:02.630
Go!

38:29.610 --> 38:31.210
You know you can't defeat me,

38:31.560 --> 38:34.230
and didn't leave yourself a chance to leave with each move.

38:34.230 --> 38:35.720
You just want to buy time

38:36.540 --> 38:38.870
and give your Yun Weishan a chance to live.

38:42.070 --> 38:42.700
Stupid!

38:43.940 --> 38:44.940
What a poor thing!

39:52.930 --> 39:53.980
If one day...

39:55.110 --> 39:56.310
you can leave here...

39:57.400 --> 39:59.120
You must run forward firmly.

40:00.300 --> 40:01.660
Use all your strength.

40:03.910 --> 40:04.840
Don't look back.

40:06.870 --> 40:07.760
Don't stop.

40:10.070 --> 40:11.330
I belong to the sunset.

40:12.400 --> 40:13.930
But maybe you can wait

40:15.700 --> 40:17.830
to see the sunrise that belongs to you.

40:18.110 --> 40:18.710
Remember,

40:23.140 --> 40:24.100
don't look back,

40:26.180 --> 40:27.150
don't stop.

41:04.230 --> 41:05.800
The sky at sunrise

41:07.060 --> 41:08.300
is colorful.

41:10.510 --> 41:11.570
It's so beautiful.

41:12.270 --> 41:13.410
What's gorgeous

41:14.670 --> 41:15.420
is not the sky

41:17.550 --> 41:18.410
but the clouds.

41:19.980 --> 41:21.240
It's colorful,

41:22.570 --> 41:24.500
like the clothes made with clouds.

41:30.050 --> 41:31.060
Yun Weishan...

41:33.300 --> 41:34.650
It's a nice name.

41:37.530 --> 41:38.680
It is.

41:42.990 --> 41:44.560
But it's not my name.

41:48.340 --> 41:49.420
It's all fake.

41:54.290 --> 41:55.350
It doesn't matter.

41:57.710 --> 41:58.970
Since you were a child,

42:00.700 --> 42:02.700
I've always called you Yun Weishan.

42:12.340 --> 42:13.320
You are

42:14.960 --> 42:16.200
the Yun Weishan

42:19.460 --> 42:20.610
in my heart.

42:35.800 --> 42:36.770
The last world

42:37.510 --> 42:38.720
in my eyes

42:40.850 --> 42:42.460
is the gorgeous sunset...

42:45.610 --> 42:46.450
Hanya Si...

42:49.100 --> 42:49.700
Take care.

42:51.790 --> 42:52.590
Take care.

43:05.170 --> 43:06.410
It's clothes

43:07.060 --> 43:08.120
made by the clouds.

43:15.030 --> 43:15.470
Sword Wielder!

43:15.470 --> 43:16.070
Elder Yue.

43:16.140 --> 43:17.310
What happened to Gong Ziyu?

43:17.310 --> 43:17.820
Hurry.

43:19.460 --> 43:20.320
He's poisoned.

43:20.550 --> 43:21.950
How could he be poisoned?

43:25.230 --> 43:26.260
It’s a witchcraft.

43:26.260 --> 43:27.130
Help him in.

44:16.710 --> 44:17.400
Elder Yue,

44:17.940 --> 44:19.270
your internal skill...

44:20.260 --> 44:22.660
It must be suppressed with internal skill.

44:24.120 --> 44:26.470
Otherwise, when the blood poisoned by witchcraft has circulated through the body

44:26.470 --> 44:27.670
and attack the heart,

44:28.580 --> 44:30.180
there'd be nothing we can do.

44:32.730 --> 44:33.530
Jin Fan.

44:34.060 --> 44:36.390
Go to my room and get the Chuyun Chonglian.

44:36.700 --> 44:37.080
Okay.

44:39.750 --> 44:40.630
What should we do?

44:40.630 --> 44:41.580
What should we do?

44:41.580 --> 44:44.710
We have to use our internal skill to seal the Sword Wielder's meridians.

44:44.710 --> 44:47.150
We can't let the poisonous blood circulate.

44:47.150 --> 44:50.210
And wait for Jin Fan to bring the Chuyun Chonglian over.

45:02.920 --> 45:03.850
Shangguan Qian?

45:11.410 --> 45:12.710
You want this too?

45:45.570 --> 45:46.750
Illusions.

45:47.990 --> 45:49.050
These are useless.

45:55.550 --> 45:57.010
I've been waiting for you.

45:57.500 --> 45:58.600
You're slower

45:58.740 --> 45:59.600
than I thought.

46:00.150 --> 46:01.280
I'm not here for you.

46:01.830 --> 46:02.290
Yes.

46:03.370 --> 46:04.310
You're here for

46:04.650 --> 46:06.450
the Infinite Heat's blueprint.

46:06.870 --> 46:07.870
What should we do?

46:07.940 --> 46:09.470
It heard that you are coming

46:09.670 --> 46:11.070
so he hid himself in fear.

46:11.370 --> 46:13.970
Putting the blueprint at the bottom of the Ice Pool,

46:13.970 --> 46:14.860
to get it,

46:15.930 --> 46:19.310
one needs to resist the chill of the thousand-year pond's bone-biting cold.

46:19.310 --> 46:21.570
It would consume a lot of internal skill.

46:22.780 --> 46:23.830
Even if they get it,

46:23.830 --> 46:26.070
they won't be able to walk out of the Gong family.

46:26.070 --> 46:28.330
Such thorough thinking, Sword Wielder.

46:29.140 --> 46:30.200
Aren't you afraid?

46:40.550 --> 46:43.010
I don't have enough internal skill anymore.

46:43.220 --> 46:44.230
Let me take a rest.

46:49.330 --> 46:50.090
Let me do it.

47:00.760 --> 47:01.350
Jin Fan.

47:02.440 --> 47:04.140
Is Mo Ji'ai here?

47:04.940 --> 47:05.860
Miss Yun...

47:06.960 --> 47:09.750
The poison the Sword Wielder was poisoned by is witchcraft.

47:09.750 --> 47:13.350
Internal skill can only suppress the spread of poisonous blood.

47:14.410 --> 47:16.070
If you really want to save him,

47:16.790 --> 47:17.170
you will...

47:17.170 --> 47:18.700
Of course I want to save him.

47:20.910 --> 47:22.040
I'll go help Jin Fan.

47:25.110 --> 47:27.440
If we can't get back the Chuyun Chonglian,

47:28.490 --> 47:29.480
the only way

47:30.800 --> 47:32.380
to save the Sword Wielder

47:34.500 --> 47:36.360
is to transfer the poisoned blood

47:36.700 --> 47:37.840
onto yourself.

48:55.690 --> 48:56.850
Where is

48:57.380 --> 48:58.580
your internal skill?

49:27.900 --> 49:28.550
Yun.

49:29.100 --> 49:30.160
What are you doing?

49:38.970 --> 49:39.770
Young Master.

49:39.810 --> 49:41.070
Don't act recklessly.

49:41.560 --> 49:43.150
Your internal skill is in chaos.

49:43.150 --> 49:44.030
Stop!

49:49.790 --> 49:50.460
Wait.

49:52.980 --> 49:55.380
Your primordial energy seems to be fusing.

51:07.270 --> 51:08.380
You forced me.

51:09.730 --> 51:10.420
Get lost!

51:56.980 --> 51:58.040
Shangguan Qian...

52:39.790 --> 52:40.480
Jin Fan...

52:49.120 --> 52:49.920
Don't cry.

52:54.430 --> 52:55.250
I won't cry.

53:16.870 --> 53:17.730
Stop laughing.

53:19.180 --> 53:20.650
Why are you laughing?

53:23.240 --> 53:24.310
I have

53:28.510 --> 53:30.100
a regret in this life.

53:35.420 --> 53:38.870
That is, I will never be able to become a Red Jade Guardian.

53:43.740 --> 53:44.450
But...

53:48.700 --> 53:49.640
this blood...

53:52.440 --> 53:54.410
dyed the Green Jade into a Red Jade.

54:01.050 --> 54:03.250
I can consider this my dream fulfilled.

54:20.500 --> 54:21.300
Jin Fan.

54:22.630 --> 54:23.490
Jin Fan.

54:27.580 --> 54:28.380
Jin Fan.

54:28.860 --> 54:29.660
Jin Fan.

54:30.380 --> 54:31.240
Jin Fan!

54:31.470 --> 54:32.600
Jin Fan!

54:32.900 --> 54:34.470
Jin Fan!

54:35.340 --> 54:36.490
Jin Fan!

54:36.740 --> 54:38.780
Elder Yue, come and save him!

54:41.300 --> 54:42.750
Jin Fan!

54:50.800 --> 54:52.250
Jin Fan...

55:48.070 --> 55:50.000
There is no one I love in this world.

55:51.110 --> 55:51.830
So,

55:53.260 --> 55:54.320
I have no weakness.

55:55.440 --> 55:55.970
You do.

56:08.740 --> 56:09.810
You love yourself.

56:14.560 --> 56:16.360
I want you to do something for me.

56:17.210 --> 56:17.920
I want you

56:18.820 --> 56:20.280
to protect someone for me.

56:44.770 --> 56:45.400
Let go!

57:06.550 --> 57:07.410
I called you...

57:12.370 --> 57:13.800
to know

57:15.570 --> 57:17.040
if you will stop for me.

57:26.620 --> 57:28.080
I already know the answer.

57:39.160 --> 57:40.520
You can leave now.

57:56.130 --> 57:57.140
You must

57:58.460 --> 57:59.350
live on.

59:30.500 --> 59:31.760
What a powerful sword!

59:32.120 --> 59:33.210
It's not the sword

59:33.890 --> 59:35.420
but the person wielding it.

59:35.820 --> 59:38.460
A master of swordsmanship does not owe it to the sword.

59:38.460 --> 59:40.190
Flying flowers and falling leaves.

59:40.190 --> 59:43.120
New candles and old clothes can all be used as swords.

59:48.090 --> 59:50.290
Though the person here is not powerful,

59:50.650 --> 59:52.290
the swords are.

59:55.940 --> 59:57.200
This is crafted painstakingly

59:57.200 --> 59:59.530
by the many generations of the Hua family.

59:59.680 --> 01:00:01.880
As long as the Wufeng is not eliminated,

01:00:02.220 --> 01:00:04.770
the Hua family will continue to forge swords forever.

01:00:04.770 --> 01:00:05.750
I will use them

01:00:07.560 --> 01:00:09.050
to kill you here!

01:01:14.830 --> 01:01:15.630
I know...

01:01:17.450 --> 01:01:19.710
you only used less than 50% of your power.

01:01:19.950 --> 01:01:20.630
30%.

01:01:22.710 --> 01:01:24.170
I don't care how much it is!

01:01:27.060 --> 01:01:28.320
I'm out of patience.

01:02:14.910 --> 01:02:15.860
An old body

01:02:16.490 --> 01:02:17.690
at the brink of death.

01:02:17.980 --> 01:02:18.840
Father!

01:02:24.010 --> 01:02:24.680
Father!

01:02:25.460 --> 01:02:26.130
Father!

01:02:26.820 --> 01:02:28.170
Father, wake up!

01:02:28.800 --> 01:02:29.510
Father!

01:02:31.430 --> 01:02:32.030
Father!

01:02:37.540 --> 01:02:38.170
This child

01:02:38.550 --> 01:02:39.390
is not gifted.

01:02:40.210 --> 01:02:41.780
They won't have much accomplishments

01:02:41.780 --> 01:02:43.090
in the future.

01:02:44.300 --> 01:02:44.900
Father...

01:02:45.690 --> 01:02:49.410
♫Will I see you again?♫

01:02:45.900 --> 01:02:48.630
You haven't seen the power of the Mountain Destroyer.

01:02:48.630 --> 01:02:50.670
I haven't become your pride yet.

01:02:51.260 --> 01:02:52.240
Even so,

01:02:52.370 --> 01:02:55.460
♫The summer we spent together is a blur now♫

01:02:52.790 --> 01:02:53.690
my child

01:02:53.900 --> 01:02:56.160
has a rare quality other kids don't have.

01:02:59.030 --> 01:03:02.710
♫Night breezes tousled your gray hair♫

01:02:59.430 --> 01:03:01.160
There are many smart children.

01:03:01.210 --> 01:03:02.430
But not many righteous

01:03:02.430 --> 01:03:03.970
and persistent children.

01:03:05.290 --> 01:03:06.530
When I first saw him,

01:03:05.580 --> 01:03:09.050
♫You looked at me in silence♫

01:03:07.260 --> 01:03:09.550
I thought he was outgoing and openminded.

01:03:09.550 --> 01:03:10.410
As time passed,

01:03:11.570 --> 01:03:13.500
I realized his unyielding and stubbornness.

01:03:11.610 --> 01:03:13.550
♫When you put your hands♫

01:03:13.650 --> 01:03:17.010
♫On my shoulders♫

01:03:17.790 --> 01:03:18.900
You are so strict.

01:03:18.590 --> 01:03:23.110
♫All my fear and hesitation were gone♫

01:03:19.530 --> 01:03:21.790
How many hardships will he have to suffer

01:03:21.990 --> 01:03:23.440
to make you proud?

01:03:24.890 --> 01:03:26.840
♫Snow falls♫

01:03:26.870 --> 01:03:30.180
♫My wound will never close♫

01:03:31.820 --> 01:03:32.370
Silly.

01:03:31.850 --> 01:03:36.190
♫I've been adrift for too long but now I'm home♫

01:03:33.930 --> 01:03:34.720
Silly child.

01:03:35.840 --> 01:03:36.240
You...

01:03:38.060 --> 01:03:38.820
have been

01:03:40.350 --> 01:03:41.840
the pride in my heart.

01:04:08.880 --> 01:04:12.260
♫Will you think of me sometimes?♫

01:04:15.630 --> 01:04:19.130
♫When the rain just stops and you feel lonely♫

01:04:22.370 --> 01:04:25.770
♫New lives are beginning in the distant mountains in the fog♫

01:04:28.880 --> 01:04:32.370
♫When tears are shed, they become flowers♫

01:04:34.300 --> 01:04:35.230
It's not good enough.

01:04:34.770 --> 01:04:36.870
♫On the porch, in the corridor♫

01:04:35.670 --> 01:04:36.910
Father won't be satisfied.

01:04:36.910 --> 01:04:40.350
♫Our past is whispering♫

01:04:41.850 --> 01:04:46.190
♫I stare at the moon and keep thinking about you♫

01:04:48.100 --> 01:04:50.080
♫Wine in my hand♫

01:04:50.100 --> 01:04:53.780
♫The old days slip through my fingers like sand♫

01:04:55.250 --> 01:04:59.550
♫I drink to forget you but only miss you even more♫

01:05:01.340 --> 01:05:03.520
♫Will you think of me sometimes?♫

01:05:03.550 --> 01:05:06.780
♫When the rain just stops and you feel lonely♫

01:05:08.250 --> 01:05:09.110
I should have

01:05:08.500 --> 01:05:12.830
♫I didn't know it'd be the last time I looked around and saw you♫

01:05:11.000 --> 01:05:11.660
praised you

01:05:12.770 --> 01:05:13.590
earlier.

01:05:14.720 --> 01:05:16.700
♫I stumble to find you♫

01:05:16.190 --> 01:05:16.780
Son...

01:05:16.720 --> 01:05:20.250
♫I have so much so say to you♫

01:05:19.700 --> 01:05:20.760
you've always been

01:05:20.790 --> 01:05:22.660
doing very well.

01:05:21.840 --> 01:05:26.210
♫Thank you, and sorry♫

01:05:26.800 --> 01:05:27.680
You have always

01:05:28.670 --> 01:05:29.870
been...

01:05:32.330 --> 01:05:35.940
♫Yesterday fades like a distant mountain♫

01:05:38.880 --> 01:05:39.390
Father!

01:05:38.900 --> 01:05:41.340
♫Tears are the snow♫

01:05:39.890 --> 01:05:40.500
Father!

01:05:41.420 --> 01:05:42.180
Father!

01:05:42.200 --> 01:05:43.420
Don't leave me.

01:05:42.690 --> 01:05:44.150
♫On the top of the mountain♫

01:05:43.440 --> 01:05:43.950
Father...
